OL,3,AWhite House bars CNN from travelling
OL,4,Awith Trump on Air Force One
OL,5,
OL,6,FBroadcaster CNN has been barred from
OL,7,Ftravelling with US President Donald
OL,8,FTrump on Air Force One for a trip to
OL,9,FTennessee on Saturday.
OL,11,FThe move is the latest in a battle
OL,12,Fbetween the White House and the media
OL,13,Fafter it was forced to lift its ban on
OL,14,Fsome news outlets.
OL,16,FCNN was scheduled to fly with Trump for
OL,17,Fhis trip to Tennessee for a college
OL,18,FAmerican football game until a note
OL,19,Freleased on Friday night by the White
OL,20,FHouse did not list the broadcaster on
OL,21,Fthe media schedule.
OL,23,APub: 26-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
